Let the sides of the pentagon be $a,$ $b,$ $c,$ $d$ and $e,$ and let $r$ and $s$ be the legs of the triangular region cut off, as shown.[asy]
size(6cm);
pair A=(0,0),B=(0,5),C=(8,5),D=(8,0),E=(8,2),F=(5.5,5);
draw(A--B--C--D--A^^E--F);
